flowchart TD
    subgraph User
        U[Human / CLI User]
    end

    subgraph Dataset
        DS1[SAMPLE_POSTS]
        DS2[TRUE_LABELS]
        DS3[EVAL_LABELS]
    end

    subgraph RuleBasedModel
        MA[MoodAnalyzer]
        REL[reliability.py]
    end

    subgraph MLModel
        VEC[CountVectorizer]
        ML[LogisticRegression]
    end

    subgraph Evaluation
        EVAL[rule-based evaluation]
        TEST[test_predict_reliable.py]
    end

    U -->|enter text| MA
    DS1 -->|sample texts| MA
    MA -->|label prediction| REL
    REL -->|reliable output| Output[CLI output / accuracy report]

    DS1 -->|training data| VEC
    DS2 -->|training labels| ML
    VEC -->|features| ML
    ML -->|predictions| Output
    DS2 -->|true labels| EVAL
    DS3 -->|normalized labels| EVAL
    REL -->|abstain / confidence| EVAL
    EVAL -->|compares labels and predictions; produces accuracy report| Output

    TEST -->|automated checks| REL
    TEST -->|prints test results| Output
    U -->|reviews results & model card| Output

